    +Converging Autoaim
    +Minimum Distance:          20
    ;+Autoaim Lock Snd:		      136
    ;+Autoaim Lost Snd:		      137
  $Convergence:
    ;; only use autoconvering if within auto aim, otherwise looks odd and is annoying to shoot spontaneous targets
    ;+Automatic
