$Template:	Longprobe Template
  +Use Template:                Rebel Fighter Template
  $Display Name:                Longprobe Starfighter
  $Short name:                  Longprobe
  $Species:                     Rebel
    +Type:                     XSTR("Reconnaissance", 832)
    +Maneuverability:          XSTR("Average", 833) ;;_3
    +Armor:                    XSTR("Moderate", 815) ;;_3
    +Manufacturer:             XSTR("Koensayr", 834)
    +Description:              XSTR(" ", 817)
    $end_multi_text
    +Tech Title:               XSTR("BTL-LP Longprobe Starfighter", 835)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("The BTL-LP Longprobe, otherwise known simply as the Y-wing Longprobe, is a variant of the standard BTL Y-wing Starfighter used by the Rebel Alliance for reconnaissance and scouting.  The ion cannons, torpedo weapon systems, and armor have been removed to make room for a powerful suite of additional sensors and electronic warfare equipment.  In addition, the bomb bays are specially retrofitted to support the launching of homing beacons.  Occupying the rear cockpit position is a combat systems officer who operates these intelligence-gathering systems.  Leftover reactor power has been rerouted to uprated engines, resulting in a lighter craft that is both faster and more maneuverable than the standard A4 model currently in service in the Rebellion.  While the vessel retains its primary weaponry and is moderately able to defend itself, Longprobe crews commonly operate alone and are instructed to avoid dogfighting wherever possible.
  
  Longprobe mission profiles include both deep space reconnaissance and combined fleet operations, where it is able to overcome enemy jamming and provide high-quality tactical data during battle.  The Alliance maintains dedicated recon squadrons while also attaching individual Longprobes to larger capital vessels, allowing them to stay one step ahead of Imperial detection, swiftly locate targets for hit-and-run strikes, and maintain equal footing in battle.", 836)
    $end_multi_text
    +Length:                   16 m
    +Gun Mounts:               1
    +Missile Banks:            1

