    $end_multi_text
    +Tech Title:               XSTR("ZY-wing Interceptor", 878)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("Not to be confused with the thoroughly useless ZIE-Fighter, the ZY-wing 'interceptor' is regarded as one of the best uglies, a truly dubious distinction.  First conceived of in the hotrod chopshops of Nar Shaddaa, this ship emerged from the non-stock racing scene that exploded following the rise of the Galactic Empire.  Built by marrying three of Koensayr's massive, fuel-guzzling R200 ion jet engines to the fuselage of the beloved Z-95 Headhunter, it achieves respectable speed but loses the Headhunter's maneuverability advantage.
    
  Ships of this type found outside the racing world are invariably owned by outlaws and mercenaries who value speed and intimidation over actual sustained combat ability.  Although it retains compatibility with many of the Z-95's aftermarket hyperdrive and astrogational upgrades, the lack of available power after the engines have eaten up their share means that the shields (if present) are flimsiplast-thin, its gun mounts are rated for older weaponry, and having guns at all means removing the targeting sensors that make the Headhunter's concussion missiles effective anti-fighter weapons.", 879)
    $end_multi_text
