;;======Transports, Freighters, etc========================================
$Template:	Star Wing Template
  +Use Template:                Big Fighter Template
  $Display Name:                Assault Gunboat
  $Short name:                  Star Wing
  $Species:                     Imperial
     +Type:                     XSTR("Heavy Assault", 888)
     +Maneuverability:          XSTR("Low", 858)
     +Armor:                    XSTR("Good", 814)
     +Manufacturer:             XSTR("Sienar Fleet Systems", 840)
     +Description:              XSTR(" ", 817)
     $end_multi_text
     +Tech Title:               XSTR("Xg-1 Star Wing Assault Gunboat", 889)
     +Tech Description:         XSTR("An anomaly in Imperial starfighter doctrine, the Xg-1 Star Wing (colloquially known as the Assault Gunboat) provides the Empire with long-ranged precision strike capability.  With a crew of two, the Gunboat bears a strong resemblance to its much larger sibling, the Sienar Fleet Systems Lambda-class shuttle.  Weapon versatility was a core design goal, and accordingly, the Gunboat is armed with an impressive array of two separate torpedo launchers and two pairs of laser cannons.  This wide range of armaments, along with the onboard hyperdrive, gives commanders considerablye optionality when dealing with hard targets in cases where discretion precludes the use of larger capital ships.  Not as maneuverable as TIE/ln Fighters and lacking any rear-facing protective turret, Star Wings use their impressive speed and firepower for devastating hit-and-run tactics and generally leave dogfighting to the short-legged TIEs where possible.", 890)
     $end_multi_text
    +Length:                   13.0 m
    +Gun Mounts:               2
    +Missile Banks:            2
  $POF file:                    starwing.pof
  $POF target LOD:              1
  $Detail distance:             (0, 400, 1000)
  $Collision LOD:               1
  $Damp:                        0.38
  $Rotdamp:                     0.42
  $Max Velocity:                0.0, 5.0, 175.0
