$Template:	Skipray Template
  +Use Template:                Big Fighter Template
  $Display Name:                Skipray Blastboat
  $Short name:                  Skipray
  $Species:                     Imperial
    +Type:                     XSTR("Gunship", 891)
    +Maneuverability:          XSTR("Average", 833) ;;_3
    +Armor:                    XSTR("Heavy", 828) ;;_5
    +Manufacturer:             XSTR("Sienar Fleet Systems", 840)
    +Description:              XSTR(" ", 817)
    $end_multi_text
    +Tech Title:               XSTR("GAT-10 Skipray Blastboat", 892)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("Originally developed for the Empire, the GAT Skipray Blastboat series has instead gained its main reputation among corporate, smuggler and mercenary pilots.  After the end of the Clone Wars the Imperial Navy began exploring multiple options for transitioning to a new fleet, which included commissioning Sienar Fleet Systems to construct a heavily-armed vessel that could serve as a gunship and heavy starfighter.  Anticipating the same immense success they'd enjoyed with the TIE Series contract, Sienar produced the Skipray Blastboat en masse.  Shortly after, Imperial Navy doctrine solidified around starfighters that were specialized for narrow tasks and supported by larger capital ships.  In this paradigm, the large, multi-purpose Skipray had no place, and most Imperial deployment contracts were dropped.
    
  To recoup production costs, Sienar sold the Skipray on the open market.  The modular weapon capabilities and high durability proved desirable for a range of customers, and private use grew quickly throughout the Galaxy.  Equipped with an ion cannon, heavy lasers, and launch systems for both torpedoes and concussion missiles, the Skipray is one of the most adaptable vessels in the private sector.  Though slower and less maneuverable than most starfighters, the Skipray boasts a dorsal turret which provides adequate cover fire if no escort fighters are available.", 893)
    $end_multi_text
    +Length:                   25.0 m
    +Gun Mounts:               2
    +Missile Banks:            2
