$Template:	Slave I Template
  +Use Template:                Big Fighter Template
  $Display Name:                Modified Firespray Patrol Craft
  $Short name:                  SlaveI
  $Species:                     Pirate
    +Type:                     XSTR("Gunship", 891)
    +Maneuverability:          XSTR("Good", 814) ;;_4
    +Armor:                    XSTR("Heavy", 828) ;;_5
    +Manufacturer:             XSTR("Kuat Systems Engineering", 873)
    +Description:              XSTR(" ", 817)
    $end_multi_text
    +Tech Title:               XSTR("Modified Firespray Patrol Craft", 894)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("Operating throughout the Outer Rim since before the Clone Wars, the Slave I has earned distinction as one of the most notorious and effective bounty hunting ships in the Galaxy.  The ship has successfully attacked high ranking leaders from multiple factions, including the Republic, Rebel Alliance, numerous planetary governments, and many criminal cartels.  

  Though visually similar to a standard Firespray gunship, this ship has been heavily augmented.  Offensive upgrades are particularly impressive, including the addition of a rear firing warhead dispenser to counter tailing ships and expanded missile bank capacity.  In addition, the front facing cannons have been retrofitted to support modern weaponry that is usually only found on much larger Imperial attack craft.  Engine power, shielding, and hull plating have also been upgraded--all of which contributes to a vessel that no crew wants to see on their rear scanners.  ", 895)
    $end_multi_text
    +Length:                   21.5 m
    +Gun Mounts:               2
    +Missile Banks:            2
