    +Description:              XSTR(" ", 817)
    $end_multi_text
    +Tech Title:               XSTR("Firespray-31 Patrol Craft", 896)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("In production since before the Clone Wars, the Firespray-31 patrol and attack craft has proven to be a reliable ship for both security forces and bounty hunters.  Designed with a focus on modularity, the weapon systems are easy to access and upgrade, allowing the pilot to equip a variety of missiles along with weapons ranging from ion blasters to high-damage heavy lasers.  Beyond the armament, the Firespray boasts thick armor plating that is especially useful in prolonged missions with no access to repair yards.  Though much of the ship is dedicated to armor and weapons, the gyroscopic main hold can hold three to five passengers or low volume, usually expensive, cargo.  The combination of survivability and ease of modification has given the Firespray a far longer useful life than many of its contemporary competitors.  ", 897)
    $end_multi_text
    +Length:                   21.5 m
    +Gun Mounts:               2
    +Missile Banks:            2
