$Template:	YT-1300 Template
  +Use Template:                Big Fighter Template
  $Display Name:                YT-1300 Freighter
  $Short name:                  YT-1300
  $Species:                     Pirate
    +Type:                     XSTR("Light Freighter", 898)
    +Maneuverability:          XSTR("Low", 858) ;;_2
    +Armor:                    XSTR("Heavy", 828) ;;_5
    +Manufacturer:             XSTR("Corellian Engineering Corporation", 899)
    +Description:              XSTR(" ", 817)
    $end_multi_text
    +Tech Title:               XSTR("YT-1300 Freighter", 902)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("Corellians have been at the forefront of commercial starship design since inventing the hyperdrive over 25,000 years ago, and the Corellian Engineering Corporation YT-1300 light freighter is a fairly typical and modestly successful representative of their current design philosophies.  First produced in the waning years of the Republic, this model, though prone to hyperdrive difficulties, has seen use by the Alliance and other independent entities well into the Galactic Civil War.
    
  Endlessly modifiable by design, the YT series is relied on throughout the Galaxy for fast passenger charter flights, independent trade, and smuggling.  There is no way of knowing what a ship of this class has 'under the hood' short of sending a scanning crew inside, so it is unwise to assume anything when dealing with a potentially dangerous situation.", 903)
    $end_multi_text
    +Length:                   35 m
