$Template:	Zeta Template
  +Use Template:                Big Fighter Template
  $Display Name:                Zeta Shuttle
  $Short name:                  Zeta
  $Species:                     Imperial
    +Type:                     XSTR("Cargo Transport", 907)
    +Maneuverability:          XSTR("Very Low", 827) ;;_1
    +Armor:                    XSTR("Heavy", 828) ;;_5
    +Manufacturer:             XSTR("Sienar Fleet Systems", 840)
    +Description:              XSTR(" ", 817)
    $end_multi_text
    +Tech Title:               XSTR("Zeta-class Heavy Cargo Shuttle", 908)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("The Zeta-class heavy cargo shuttle serves a critical role in transporting Imperial goods across the Galaxy.  The main hull was designed around Imperial cargo containers, which allows the Zeta to pick up and drop off cargo at a faster rate than any other Imperial transport ship.  Such shipping optimizations helped fuel the Empire's expansion and supply chain growth.
    
  Though primarily used for cargo shipping, the Zeta can alternatively carry over fifty well-armed troops.  The weapon systems are all forward facing and pilot controlled, allowing the Zeta to punch through combat zones or effectively clear a landing zone to deliver much-needed supplies.  In battle situations the Zeta is assigned TIE escorts, as the combination of poor maneuverability and lack of rear facing turret make the shuttle a prime target for hostile fighters.  Fortunately, the Zeta's heavy armor allows the ship to withstand prolonged attacks.  ", 909)
    $end_multi_text
