    +Manufacturer:             XSTR("Telgorn Corporation", 911)
    +Description:              XSTR(" ", 817)
    $end_multi_text
    +Tech Title:               XSTR("Delta-class DX-9 Transport", 912)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("The Telgorn Corporation Delta-class DX-9 troop transport is the last thing any ship harboring Rebels wants to see.  Heavily armed with four twin blaster cannons, four ion cannons, and ten torpedo tubes, this ship is capable of disabling vessels many times its size.  Once its target is out of the fight, the DX-9 can deploy a complement of up to thirty stormtroopers via either of two robust docking collars, systems capable of attaching to and breaching almost any ship in existence, even during active combat.  Besides its lack of maneuverability, this transport's only major weakness is its lack of turreted weapons--like most ships of its size, it must rely on close escort to defend against enemy fighters.", 913)
    $end_multi_text
