    +Description:              XSTR(" ", 817)
    $end_multi_text
    +Tech Title:               XSTR("UT-60D U-wing Transport", 914)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("While the Rebellion makes good use of a variety of modified civilian transports, the UT-60D U-wing is a rare purpose-built utility craft designed for combat.  Incom designed the U-wing as a fast troop transport and gunship, able to swiftly deliver troops to the frontline and support them with cover fire.  Armed with a pair of forward-facing laser cannons, the craft can also mount heavy infantry weapons on the side loading doors.  The U-wing is crewed by two pilots and can carry eight fully equipped troops.  The versatility of this heavily armored ship allows it to be deployed in a wide variety of roles beyond carrying troops, such as VIP transport, medivac, gunship, and light cargo freighter.", 915)
    $end_multi_text
    +Length:                   25 m
    +Gun Mounts:               1
    +Missile Banks:            0
