$Template:	Action VI Template
  +Use Template:                Common Transport Template
  $Display Name:                Action VI Transport
  $Short name:                  Action6
  $Species:                     Pirate
    +Tech Title:                XSTR("Action VI Transport", 919)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("A popular entry in the Corellian Engineering Corporation's Action series, the VI is an unarmed bulk transport used by private enterprises along with the Alliance and Imperial militaries.  At one hundred and twenty-five meters in length and with a cargo capacity of fifty-thousand tons, this vessel is substantially larger than those of the YT series, though it lacks the fully modular interior layout that makes that line so successful.  It is nonetheless a well-built Corellian design and is commonly found in the hands of medium market traders who prefer not to take on modular cargo containers such as those used by the popular BFF-1 Bulk Freighter.  Though it achieves decent speed in hyperspace, this ship in its unmodified state is totally helpless at sublight speeds, having only minimal shielding to protect it.  For this reason, it often can be found in convoys when traveling far from established lanes and protected systems.", 920)
    $end_multi_text
