$Template:	Corellian Star Template
  +Use Template:                Common Transport Template
  $Display Name:                Star Shuttle
  $Short name:                  Star Shuttle
  $Species:                     Pirate
    +Tech Title:                XSTR("Corellian CSS-1 Star Shuttle", 921)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("Corellian Engineering Corporation's Star Shuttle is a specialized passenger transport vessel originally designed to ferry diplomatic missions during the time of the Republic.  Heavily shielded and armored for its size, the vessel's original configuration accommodated two hundred passengers and could haul 900 tons of cargo.  These unarmed ships often formed the backbone of mercy missions dispatched to planets ravaged by disease, natural disaster, or war.  

  During the Clone Wars, the increased danger of travel caused many political figures to turn to CEC's armed corvettes for protection, and under the New Order, the fusion of military and civilian offices as embodied in the Moff hierarchy has resulted in most diplomatic duties being handled by the warships of the Imperial Starfleet.  Because of this, many of the old Star Shuttles have been sold at auction, variously finding their way into the hands of shipping interests and other independent organizations.", 922)
    $end_multi_text
