$Template:	GR-75 Template
  +Use Template:                Common Transport Template
  $Display Name:                Gallofree Transport
  $Short name:                  GR75
  $Species:                     Rebel
    +Tech Title:                XSTR("Gallofree-class GR-75 Transport", 925)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("Initially designed for cargo hauling by Gallofree Yards, the GR-75 has become a versatile workhorse in the Alliance fleet.  Though the cargo capacity is inferior to that of the larger BFF-1 Bulk Freighter, the more compact structure provides several benefits.  The structure is highly streamlined for cargo protection, with a heavily armored shell encasing loaded cargo along with robust deflector shields for a ship of only ninety meters.  The engines are specifically engineered for fast acceleration and travel times, which provides a critical advantage to the Alliance fleet, especially when attempting to evade Imperial capture.  Finally, the high degree of cargo modularity allows the ship to be loaded quickly and easily retrofitted for specific fleet roles.
    
  While the Alliance most often uses the GR-75 in its intended transport role, Rebel technicians have at various times adapted the modifiable cargo bays to support heavy gun armaments, modular medical containers, portable scanning modules, and even troop quarters.  In the most dire situations, GR-75 transports have also been loaded with explosive cargo and crewed by droids to serve as makeshift fire ships that can cause critical damage to even capital ships many times the transport's size.  These strengths aside, the GR-75 is still highly vulnerable to sustained capital ship fire or targeted attacks from bombers, and thus a protective escort of at least two fighters is standard protocol.", 926)
    $end_multi_text
