$Template:	DV3 Template
  +Use Template:                Common Transport Template
  $Display Name:                DV-3 Freighter
  $Short name:                  Repair Tug
  $Species:                     Republic
    +Tech Title:                XSTR("DV-3 Cargo Freighter", 928)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("Developed in the early years of the New Order, the DV-3 is a highly optimized cargo freighter.  Though only able to ship one large container compared to the four that can be transported by the larger BFF-1, the DV-3 is both cheaper and faster.  The scaffold outline of the ship's main body, sans cargo, demonstrates this core design principle--that all unnecessary components have been removed to minimize cost and maximize speed.  The large Koensayr engines provide faster acceleration than that available to the slightly larger BFF-1, though at the cost of a weaker hull.
    
  Because this freighter is relatively cheap, the cargo it hauls is usually more valuable than the ship itself.  Capable of transporting a wide range of goods, the DV-3 is perhaps best known for being able to quickly either deploy or retrieve smaller non-piloted craft such as repair droids and sensor probes.  In a pinch the rapid deployment container has even been used to rescue stranded escape pods.  While the presence of two twin-barreled light turbolasers is an effective deterrent against opportunistic attack, the freighter has little chance of withstanding a dedicated assault.", 929)
    $end_multi_text
  $POF file:                    repair-tug.pof
  $POF target LOD:              1
  $Detail distance:             (0, 700, 1300, 3800)
  $Collision LOD:               1
  $Damp:                        0.6 ; big ship damp
  $Rotdamp:                     1.0 ; big ship rot damp
  $Max Velocity:                0.0, 5.0, 100.0 ;big ship speed velocity vector (needs y speed to dock)
  $Rotation time:               22, 25, 18
  $Rear Velocity:               0.0
  $Forward accel:               20.0 ;big ship accel
  $Forward decel:               0.0 ;big ship decel, follows wp to move
  $Shields:                     3200
    ;+Auto Spread: 10
    ;+Spread From LOD: 3
  $Shield Regeneration Rate:    0.00 ;captial ship shield regen
  +Shield Regen Hit Delay:      4.0  ;captial ship shield delay
  ;$Weapon Regeneration Rate:
