$Template:	BFF Template
  +Use Template:                Common Frigate Template
  $Display Name:                BFF-1 Freighter
  $Short name:                  BFF1
  $Species:                     Republic
    +Tech Title:                XSTR("BFF-1 Bulk Freighter", 931)
    +Tech Description:         XSTR("Phylon Freight's BFF-1 may not look like much, but its design is the product of thousands of years of intense competition in galactic commerce.  The unmodified model exclusively hauls Class-A cargo containers, a standard that sees extensive use both on highly developed worlds and in more rugged Rim territories.  The BFF-1 recently received a boost when the currently dominant shipping conglomerate Xizor Transport Systems elected to adopt and begin manufacture of the Class-A standard shortly before aggressively pushing into the Expansion Region.

  Like most bulk haulers, this class is configured to maximize the benefits of mature, low-performance (but high-efficiency) hyperdrive technology.  What separates it from the competition is its low cost, outstanding reliability, and longevity.  Though most shipping concerns prefer to always run their freight lines with a full complement for insurance purposes, it is not uncommon for BFF-1s to go for months or even years with only a single sentient or droid (whichever is cheaper or more reliable) for crew.  This practice is tolerated because these ships' service lives are measured in hundreds of years, meaning that over the course of hundreds of thousands of hyperspace jumps, a given ship will most likely be captured, lost, destroyed, or otherwise rendered inoperable by random events long before the effects of a missed maintenance cycle become apparent.", 932)
    $end_multi_text
  $POF file:                    bff1.pof
