$Template:	Gozanti #Imp Template
  +Use Template:                Common Transport Template
  $Display Name:                Gozanti Armed Transport
  $Short name:                  Gozanti (Imp)
  $Species:                     Imperial
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("Gozanti-class Armed Transport", 936)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("At the request of the Imperial Navy, Corellian Engineering Corporation upgraded the original Gozanti design for military use.  Additional armor increased the vessel's survivability under fire, while uprated engines provided the power required to carry the heavier loads necessitated by military logistics.  Military-grade turbolaser batteries mounted dorsally and ventrally give the ship enough firepower to fend off enemy fighters and provide light fire support where needed.
  
  The Imperial Gozanti-class cruiser is deployed in a wide variety of military support roles throughout the Galaxy.  The smallest class of warship in active use by the Empire, the Gozanti is just large enough to support docking capabilities--including up to four TIEs or two AT-ATs.  Still, the cruiser cannot sustain extended attacks alone and is usually deployed with substantial fighter escort, or as part of a larger force.  Its small size does allow the Gozanti to rapidly deploy and/or repair, making it extremely useful when responding to a quickly-developing combat situation.  In particular, the ability to insert or extract TIE groups or quickly deliver Imperial walkers to reinforce a planet garrison is essential for adapting to the ever-changing guerrilla tactics employed by Rebel forces.  ", 937)
  $end_multi_text
  $POF file:           		  gozanti_imp.pof
