$Template:	Gozanti #Pir Template
  +Use Template:                Common Transport Template
  $Display Name:                Gozanti Armed Transport
  $Short name:                  Gozanti (Pir)
  $Species:                     Pirate
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("C-ROC Gozanti-class Transport", 938)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("After the rise of the Empire, the Republic Gozanti was replaced by the upgraded Imperial model.  During the lengthy transition, many of the original ships disappeared, only to later resurface in use by Rebels, smugglers, and pirates.  One of the most common modifications was the Configuration-Restored Operational Capacity upgrade--or C-ROC--which expanded the port and starboard decks with up to eight small-scale cargo docking ports, substantially enhancing the ship's cargo capacity.  Unfortunately for shippers and smugglers, the original engines were never designed to accommodate the extra bulk--at best the ship could reach one third of optimal cruising speed and at worst the engine regulators would fail and ignite.  The most common solution was to add an additional engine block above each of the existing three engines.  Though a somewhat over-engineered solution, doubling the engine output provided acceleration rates far better than even those of the more heavily-armed Imperial models.  The combination of expanded cargo capacity and substantially powerful engines provided fast and secure transport capabilities and a healthy profit margin for both legitimate and illegitimate organizations throughout the Galaxy.", 939)
  $end_multi_text
