$Template:	Braha'tok Template
  +Use Template:                Common Transport Template
  $Display Name:                Braha'tok Gunship
  $Short name:                  Braha'tok
  $Species:                     Pirate
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("Braha'tok-class Gunship", 940)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("Commonly known as the Dornean Gunship, this vessel is by far the most important product of Dornean Braha'ket Fleetworks Conglomerate's shipbuilding efforts.  Dornea's status as an Outer Rim backwater with few economic resources combined with a long military history has forged a strong reputation for self-reliance and a natural affinity for defensive ship building in the Dornean species which is exemplified in their signature gunship.

  In spite of its small size, the Braha'tok is a capable combat vessel.  Built to engage hostile patrol craft at maximum range, the gunship has a slim profile which helps minimize the threat of turbolaser fire at a distance.  Though unsuited for extended deployments, the ship itself requires less maintenance than would be expected thanks to the practical design principles followed by Dornean engineers.  Acknowledging their limited shipbuilding experience, Braha'ket Fleetworks elected to plan its product around the various major manufacturers' most reliable aftermarket subsystems--the only components of the gunship which actually come from Dornea itself are its durasteel hull plates.  This philosophy has yielded a robust (if somewhat unconventional) design which the Dornean Navy hopes to field for decades to come.", 941)
  $end_multi_text
