  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("Marauder-class Corvette", 948)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("Designed by the Sienar Technologies branch of what was then Republic Sienar Systems, the Marauder-class corvette is a heavily armed pre-Clone Wars patrol and escort craft.  Although it was recognized as a well built ship at the time of its introduction, the Republic ultimately decided to overhaul their large fleet of Corellian-built corvettes rather than picking up a new Sienar contract.  The official reason for this decision was that the CR corvettes' speed and multi-role adaptability made them a wiser investment, but many have surmised that the motivating factors were in fact entirely political.

  After limited sales to other governments, Republic Sienar regretfully offered the production rights to the Corporate Sector Authority, a group whose needs were perfectly matched to the craft's strengths.  The Authority has maintained steady production of this design to the present day, employing the ship primarily in an anti-piracy role.  Like most Corporate Sector technologies not restricted by Imperial export agreements, older Marauders are typically sold before wear and tear causes their value to depreciate below a certain threshold.  Because they are relatively inexpensive but proven ships that come under warranty from a trusted source, these vessels can now be found throughout the Galaxy and are among the most powerful that can be legally owned by private organizations.", 949)
  $end_multi_text
