$Template:	MC30 Template
  +Use Template:                Common Frigate Template
  $Display Name:                MC30 Frigate
  $Short name:                  MC30
  $Species:                     Rebel
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("MC30-class Frigate", 956)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("By the time of the Clone Wars, the Mon Cal had built up a reputation as excellent explorers, famed for pushing deep into the Unknown Regions and Wild Space on multi-year journeys.  After the establishment of the Empire, the Mon Cal were tolerated due to the Emperor's insatiable hunger for new territory, but their place in the overtly human-supremacist New Order was abundantly clear.

  Mon Cal master shipwrights first started militarizing their ships with the relatively small MC30 generation.  Although the MC30-class frigate is smaller and more lightly-armored then Imperial Strike-class Cruisers, it is still larger than the common frigate- and corvette-class ships commonly in use by the Alliance.  A benefit of Mon Cal design patterns is that the organic and rounded structure of the ship provides turrets with a wider field of view and allows the ship to bring a higher percentage of guns to bear in any given direction.  These factors, combined with the ship's highly sophisticated shield systems, place its combat capabilities well beyond what is typical for ships of its size.  Though the vessel remains vulnerable to targeted bomber attacks and large Imperial cruisers, the initial success of the MC30-class frigate helped pave the way for the much larger and more ambitious generations of Mon Cal cruisers that followed.", 957)
  $end_multi_text
  $POF file:                    mc30.pof
  $POF target LOD:              1
  $Detail distance:             (0, 1800, 3500, 8000)
  $Collision LOD:               1
  $Damp:                        0.6 ; big ship damp 
  $Rotdamp:                     1.0 ; big ship rot damp	
  $Max Velocity:                0.0, 5.0, 100.0 ;big ship speed velocity vector (needs y speed to dock)
  $Rotation time:               70, 81, 60
  $Rear Velocity:               0.0
  $Forward accel:               20.0 ;big ship accel
  $Forward decel:               0.0 ;big ship decel, follows wp to move
  $Default PBanks:              ()
  $Default SBanks:              ()
  $SBank Capacity:              ()
  $Shields:                     30700 
    ;+Auto Spread: 75
    ;+Spread From LOD: 2
  $Shield Regeneration Rate:    0.00 ;captial ship shield regen
  +Shield Regen Hit Delay:      4.0  ;captial ship shield delay
  $Max Oclk Speed:              100.0 ;big ship velocity max speed
  $Max Weapon Eng:              100.0
  $Hitpoints:                   52800
  $Hull Repair Rate:            0.0
  $Subsystem Repair Rate:       0.0
  $Armor Type:				          Capital_Hull_Armor
  $Shield Armor Type:           Capital_Shield_Armor
  $Flags:                       ( "large ship deathroll" "capital" "model point shields" "disable all generic impact debris" "disable all generic explosion debris" "no ets" "no ets" ) 
  $AI Class:                    AI_07_Captain
  $Afterburner:                 NO
  $Scan time:                   5000
  $EngineSnd:                   211
  $Minimum Engine Volume:       0.4
  $Closeup_pos:                 0.0, 0.0, -375
  $Closeup_zoom:                0.5
  $Closeup_pos_targetbox:       0.0, 0.0, -1350
  $Closeup_zoom_targetbox:      0.2
