;;                   			  MC40
$Template:	MC40 Template
  +Use Template:                Common CruiserMedium Template
  $Display Name:                MC40 Cruiser
  $Short name:                  MC40
  $Species:                     Rebel
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("MC40-class Cruiser", 962)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("The lessons learned in the development and deployment of the MC30 frigate were many.  The deep understanding and shipbuilding expertise of Mon Calamari's engineers enabled them to swiftly apply those lessons to a new generation of ships, this time with a larger frame.

  The resulting MC40-class cruiser is of a similar size to the older Dreadnaught cruisers, though its armament is slightly inferior.  Fortunately, the MC40 is able to focus many guns on a single target thanks to the wide field of view the unique Mon Cal design provides.  Robust deflector shields allow the cruiser to remain in combat for long periods and even survive scuffles with Imperial Star Destroyers.  Though not equipped to challenge such large vessels directly, the MC40 fulfills vital support roles while the Alliance Navy awaits the deployment of larger MC ships.", 963)
  $end_multi_text
  $POF file:                    mc40.pof
  $POF target LOD:              1
  $Detail distance:             (0, 2600, 5300, 9000)
  $Collision LOD:               1
  $Damp:                        0.6 ; big ship damp 
  $Rotdamp:                     1.0 ; big ship rot damp	
  $Max Velocity:                0.0, 5.0, 100.0 ;big ship speed velocity vector (needs y speed to dock)
  $Rotation time:               84, 97, 72
  $Rear Velocity:               0.0
  $Forward accel:               20.0 ;big ship accel
  $Forward decel:               0.0 ;big ship decel, follows wp to move
  $Default PBanks:              ()
  $Default SBanks:              ()
  $SBank Capacity:              ()
  $Shields:                     40300
    ;+Auto Spread: 75
    ;+Spread From LOD: 2
  $Shield Regeneration Rate:    0.00 ;captial ship shield regen
  +Shield Regen Hit Delay:      4.0  ;captial ship shield delay
  $Max Oclk Speed:              100.0 ;big ship velocity max speed
