;; ========================================================================
;;                   			 Liberty
$Template:	Liberty Template
  +Use Template:                Common CruiserLarge Template
  $Display Name:                MC80 Cruiser
  $Short name:                  Liberty
  $Species:                     Rebel
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("MC80-class Cruiser", 972)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("Following the success of the MC40 generation, Mon Cal master shipwrights began work on a new, larger generation of cruisers with the MC80-class.  These ships are superficially similar to the exploration and passenger vessels that came before, but underneath the skin, they have been completely reinvented.  Vulnerable subsystems are inconspicuously hidden behind storage blisters that can be easily armored, power conduits are redirected so that turbolaser batteries can be mounted to the hull with minimal work, and hangar decks have been reengineered to quickly rearm and repair full fighter wings.  

  The Mon Cal species' aquatic background is evidenced not only in the flowing lines of these larger ships, but also in the three-dimensional thinking that informs their design principles.  In contrast to the rigid formations and offensive focus developed by the Imperial Starfleet during the wars, the MC80s are capable of omnidirectional force projection that can shift unpredictably, moving like a school of fish to maximize the effect of their advanced rotating and overlapping shields.
  
  The winged Liberty-type, nearly a match for an Imperial Star Destroyer despite its smaller size, is one of the most refined and well-optimized bearers of the MC80 name.", 973)
  $end_multi_text
  $POF file:                    liberty.pof
  $POF target LOD:              1
  $Detail distance:             (0, 3200, 6500, 12000)
  $Collision LOD:               1
  $Damp:                        0.6 ; big ship damp 
  $Rotdamp:                     1.0 ; big ship rot damp	
  $Max Velocity:                0.0, 5.0, 100.0 ;big ship speed velocity vector (needs y speed to dock)
  $Rotation time:               155, 179, 132
  $Rear Velocity:               0.0
  $Forward accel:               20.0 ;big ship accel
  $Forward decel:               0.0 ;big ship decel, follows wp to move
  $Warpout accel exp:           1.7
  $Default PBanks:              ()
  $Default SBanks:              ()
  $SBank Capacity:              ()
  $Shields:                     104000 ;
    ;+Auto Spread: 75
    ;+Spread From LOD: 2
  $Shield Regeneration Rate:    0.00 ;captial ship shield regen
  +Shield Regen Hit Delay:      4.0  ;captial ship shield delay
  $Max Oclk Speed:              100.0 ;big ship velocity max speed
  $Max Weapon Eng:              100.0
  $Hitpoints:                   403600 ;ISD Hitpoints 475,000
  $Hull Repair Rate:            0.0
  $Subsystem Repair Rate:       0.0
  $Armor Type:				          Capital_Hull_Armor
  $Shield Armor Type:           Capital_Shield_Armor
  $Flags:                       ( "large ship deathroll" "capital" "model point shields" "disable all generic impact debris" "disable all generic explosion debris" "no ets" ) 
  $AI Class:                    AI_07_Captain
  $Afterburner:                 NO
  $Scan time:                   7000
  $EngineSnd:                   211
  $Minimum Engine Volume:       0.4
  $Closeup_pos:                 0.0, 0.0, -1300
