;; ========================================================================
;;                   			Home One
$Template:	Home One Template
  +Use Template:                Common CruiserSuper Template
  $Display Name:                MC80A Cruiser
  $Short name:                  Home One
  $Species:                     Rebel
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("MC80A-class Cruiser", 974)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("The crown jewel of the MC80 generation was the Home One type, a group of ships that promised to push the boundaries of known space in a way that had not been dreamed of since the disappearance of Outbound Flight.  These ships, almost four kilometers in length, would enable journeys decades in length and were capable of single handedly charting entire new sectors.  It came as a rude awakening for the Empire when they began to disappear from their intended duties and reappear at the forefront of Rebel fleet groups.  Not only was the Rebel Alliance now equipped, for the first time, with warships that could challenge the Star Destroyers of the Imperial Navy head-on--but they had been built by a species of nonhumans armed with little more than their ingenuity and will to fight.  Perhaps more important than the MC80A's impenetrable shielding or its powerful turbolaser batteries is the belief it engenders in many: that human and alien alike may struggle against the Empire, and that the struggle is not futile.", 975)
  $end_multi_text
  $POF file:                    homeone.pof
  $POF target LOD:              1
  $Detail distance:             (0, 4500, 9000, 50000)
  $Collision LOD:               1
  $Damp:                        0.6 ; big ship damp 
  $Rotdamp:                     1.0 ; big ship rot damp	
  $Max Velocity:                0.0, 5.0, 100.0 ;big ship speed velocity vector (needs y speed to dock)
  $Rotation time:               287, 330, 244
  $Rear Velocity:               0.0
  $Forward accel:               20.0 ;big ship accel
  $Forward decel:               0.0 ;big ship decel, follows wp to move
  $Warpout accel exp:           1.75
