$Template:	Asteroid Base Template
  +Use Template:                Common Station Template
  $Display Name:                Asteroid Station
  $Short name:                  Asteroid Base
  $Species:                     Pirate
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("BM-class Asteroid Station", 978)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("Building into the solid rock of a large asteroid is the cheapest and oftentimes most practical way of establishing an installation.  The bulk of these stations are eventually abandoned either for more efficient platforms or when their natural mineral supplies are exhausted.  As asteroids are generally the most easily exploited source of hypermatter and valuable minerals, inhabited systems often have a scattering of empty asteroid facilities left over from earlier times.  These abandoned posts sometimes find new life as research stations, novel commercial ventures, or temporary refuge from unrest, but they are more often used by pirates, smugglers, and other groups that wish to operate out of sight of the law.", 979)
  $end_multi_text
