$Template:	XQ2 #Reb Template
  +Use Template:                Common Station Template
  $Display Name:                XQ2 Platform
  $Short name:                  XQ2
  $Species:                     Pirate
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("XQ2-class Platform", 982)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("A common installation found everywhere from the Core through the Outer Rim, Bengel Shipbuilders' XQ2 space station is a relatively inexpensive orbital or deep space base capable of facilitating a variety of commercial and military operations.

  Functional with a fairly small crew for its size, the XQ series was designed to enable the transfer of vast amounts of cargo and personnel in systems that lacked suitable preexisting infrastructure.  Due to their competitive cost of upkeep, they have also found use as temporary holding facilities in built up systems, allowing for a more efficient division of freight handling tasks between dedicated orbital lifters and hyperspace-capable transports.  To that end, the station's three large landing platforms can accommodate a wide variety of vessels, and the upper structure houses a great deal of secure long-term storage.

  The XQ2 is equipped with a number of turbolaser batteries, but the stock units are barely up to the task of covering such a large area, so Imperial outposts are typically also defended by one or more starships at all times.", 983)
  $end_multi_text
  $POF file:                    xq2.pof
  $POF target LOD:              1
  $Detail distance:             (0, 3000, 20000)
  $Collision LOD:               1
  $Damp:                        0.6 ; big ship damp
  $Rotdamp:                     1.0 ; big ship rot damp
  $Max Velocity:                0.0, 0.0, 0.0
  $Rotation time:               100000.0, 100000.0, 100000.0
  $Rear Velocity:               0.0
  $Forward accel:               0.0
  $Forward decel:               0.0
  $Default PBanks:              ( )
  $Default SBanks:              ( )
  $SBank Capacity:              ( )
  $Shields:                     33800
    ;+Auto Spread: 35
    ;+Spread From LOD: 1
  $Shield Regeneration Rate:    0.00 ;captial ship shield regen
  +Shield Regen Hit Delay:      4.0  ;captial ship shield delay
  $Max Oclk Speed:              0.0
  $Max Weapon Eng:              100.0
  $Hitpoints:                   300500
  $Hull Repair Rate:            0.0
  $Subsystem Repair Rate:       0.0
