$Template:	Defense Satellite #R Template
  +Use Template:                Common Other Template
  $Display Name:                Defense Satellite
  $Short name:      			      Sat_Defense (R)
  $Species:            		      Rebel
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("D-12 Defense Satellite", 988)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("The D-12 defense satellite is an armed satellite platform developed by the Corporate Sector Authority for the defense of orbital installations and targets such as space stations, construction docks and industrial platforms.  Armed with twin missile pods and dual rapid-firing laser cannons, these satellites pose a threat to any craft of frigate size or below.", 989)
  $end_multi_text
  $POF file:          		      satellite_defense.pof
  $POF target LOD:              0
  $Detail distance:             (0, 850, 2500, 3500)
  $Collision LOD:				        1
  $Damp:             			      0.6 ; big ship damp
  $Rotdamp:            		      1.0 ; big ship rot damp
  $Max Velocity:     			      0.0, 0.0, 0.0
  $Rotation time:     		      100000.0, 100000.0, 100000.0
  $Rear Velocity:     		      0.0
  $Forward accel:     		      0.0
  $Forward decel:     		      0.0
