  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("One of the most common sensor satellites utilized throughout the Galaxy, the D-8 is generally used as a navigation buoy or advance warning system.  Those used in military applications usually have sophisticated electronics and shield generators.  Though similar in structure to the armed D-12 defense model, this model lacks weapons and is easily destroyed if left unprotected.  ", 991)
