$Template:	Mine Template
  +Use Template:                Common Other Template
  $Display Name:                Modular Mine
  $Short name:      			      Mine
  $Species:            		      Pirate
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("HX Modular Mine", 992)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("The HX series encompasses several models of static-defense explosive device.  The most common and least expensive of these is the proximity mine, which detonates upon detecting that a ship without the correct IFF codes has entered its configurable kill radius.  The most expensive variant is the seeker mine, which, equipped with simple engines, pursues its target before detonation--making it more suitable for use against small, nimble blockade runners.  All HX series mines can be loaded with conventional or ion explosives.

Mines are designed primarily to deter large ships and have no real defense against competent fighter attack.  Accordingly, they are best deployed in tandem with fighter screens.", 993)
  $end_multi_text
  $POF file:           		      spacemine.pof
  $POF target LOD:              0
  $Detail distance:             (0, 800, 2500)
  $Collision LOD:				        1
  $Damp:            			      0.6 ; big ship damp
  $Rotdamp:           		      1.0 ; big ship rot damp
  $Max Velocity:          	    30.0, 30.0, 30.0
  $Rotation time:               10.0, 10.0, 15.0
  $Rear Velocity:               0.0
  $Forward accel:               6.0
  $Forward decel:               0.0 ;big ship decel, follows wp to move
  ;; use custom explosion instead of weapons since this allows FREDer to set custom explosion size 
  ;; also allows freder to set ion or particle type as ship class then distance trigger with weapons, 
  ;; which allows for many more combinations while minimizing both ship classes and weappon classes
  $Expl inner rad:        	    250.0
  $Expl outer rad:       		    400.0
  $Expl damage:          		    6000.0
  $Expl blast:            	    2500.0
  $Expl Propagates:       	    NO
  $Ship Death Effect:           PE_Explosion_Ship_Small_Rebel
  $Skip Death Roll Percent Chance:     100; explode instantly always since it detonates!
  $Default PBanks:              ( )
  $Default SBanks:              ( )
  $SBank Capacity:              ( )
  $Shields:               	    0
  $Shield Regeneration Rate:    0.00
  +Shield Regen Hit Delay:      4.0  ;captial ship shield delay
  $Max Oclk Speed:    		      0.0
  $Max Weapon Eng:    		      100.0
  $Hitpoints:             	    500
  $Hull Repair Rate:            0.0
  $Subsystem Repair Rate:       0.0 
  ;; ^^allow disabled detonation trigger turrets to repair themselves...? No, as no way to tell if turret trigger dead since untargetable
  ;;   only way to disarm internal turret trigger is with ion cannons, since those do shockwave damage
  $Armor Type:				          Capital_Hull_Armor 
  $Shield Armor Type:           Capital_Shield_Armor
  ;; ^^or Starfighter to reduce particle shockwave? 
  ;;   wouldn't make sense though seeing one mine next to another and not die with only particle mines, 
  ;;   thus be easier to just place mines correctly
  $Flags:                       ( "sentry gun" "disable all generic impact debris" "disable all generic explosion debris" "model point shields" "no ets" "intrinsic no shields" ) 
  $AI Class:           		      AI_07_Captain
  $Afterburner:                 NO
  $Scan time:           		    1500
  $EngineSnd:    				        199
  $Closeup_pos:      	   		    0.0, 0.0, -18
  $Closeup_zoom:     			      0.5
  $Closeup_pos_targetbox:       0.0, 0.0, -22
  $Closeup_zoom_targetbox:      0.5
  $Shield_icon:                 _Shield-SpaceMine
  $Briefing icon:
    +Regular:                   Icon-SpaceMine
    +Fade:                      FadeIcon-SpaceMine
    +Highlight:                 iconhighlight04
  $Briefing icon with cargo:
    +Regular:                   Icon-SpaceMine
    +Fade:                      FadeIcon-SpaceMine
    +Highlight:                 iconhighlight04
  $Briefing wing icon:
    +Regular:                   Icon-SpaceMineW
    +Fade:                      FadeIcon-SpaceMineW
    +Highlight:                 iconhighlight04
  $Briefing wing icon with cargo:
    +Regular:                   Icon-SpaceMineW
    +Fade:                      FadeIcon-SpaceMineW
    +Highlight:                 iconhighlight04
  $Score:       				        7
  $Thruster Bitmap 1:           Glw_Ths_06_Orn
  $Thruster01 Radius factor:    0.1
  ;$Thruster Bitmap 3:           null_effect
  ;$Thruster03 Radius factor:    0.1
  $Thruster Glow Noise Mult:    0.0
  $Radar Image 2D:              radar-spacemine
  $3D Radar Blip Size Multiplier: 2.5

  ;$Animations:                  ( "" )

  $Subsystem: Communication, 8, 0.0
    $Alt Subsystem Name:         Communications
    $Armor Type:                 Capital_Subsystem_Armor
  $Subsystem: Engine, 30, 0.0
    $Alt Subsystem Name:         Engine
    $Armor Type:                 Capital_Subsystem_Armor
  $Subsystem: Turret, 100, 0.0 ;recall turret is inside mine and is how detonation works 
    $Alt Subsystem Name:         Detonation Type ;;cannot target b/c most weapons cannot reach the detonation trigger
    $Armor Type:                 Capital_Hull_Armor
    $Default PBanks:             ( "Detonation#250m" )
    $PBank Capacity:			       ( 1 )
    $Flags:                      ( "damage as hull" "only target if can fire" "burst ignores rof mult" "no subsystem targeting" "ignore if dead" )
