  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("J-5 Sensor Probe", 994)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("The J-5 Sensor Probe is inexpensive and sturdy, which has resulted in widespread use.  Unlike the D-8 satellite, which was designed for use in static sensor networks, the J-5--unshielded and unarmed--is built to autonomously enter and search unexplored areas.  In a military context, the probe's low mass and well-supported thrusters give it an excellent ability to retreat to safety where necessary--while its small size makes it difficult for the enemy to detect.", 995)
