  XSTR("Unarmed and unshielded, the Class-6 Escape Pod is a last-ditch means of escaping a dire situation.  Only large enough for six humanoids, a pod such as this rarely comes under fire when more pressing targets are nearby.  As the craft is equipped only with maneuvering thrusters and no hyperdrive, the passengers' chances of survival depend greatly on the proximity of allied ships--or the mercy of hostile forces.", 997)
