$Template:	Repair Droid Template
  +Use Template:                Common Other Template
  $Display Name:                Utility Droid
  $Short name:      			      Utility Droid
  $Species:            		      Republic
  +Tech Title:                  XSTR("DKT Utility Droid", 998)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("The DKT Utility Droid has become one of the most cost-effective space utility and repair droids produced throughout the Galaxy.  Equipped with three tri-joint articulated arms, the DKT is well-suited for ferrying small cargo and performing repair and maintenance on a wide range of vessels, from light starfighters to the largest of capital ships.  In addition to the standard fusion cutters and gripping claws, the droid's arms can be equipped with mobile plasma drills, which are commonly used in a resource extraction role.  Like many droids, the DKT can fold into a compact configuration for storage or transport, and reactivation is quick and easy.  While it has no shields or armor, nor even substantial engines, the DKT is cheap to replace if destroyed or critically damaged.  ", 999)
  $end_multi_text
