$Template:	Nav Buoy Template
  +Use Template:            Common Other Template
  $Species: 					      Republic
  +Tech Title:              XSTR("J-1 Nav Buoy", 1000)
  +Tech Description:
  XSTR("Navigation buoys are small markers used to assist ships in following hyperlanes between systems, especially through dangerous areas of space.  While military vessels almost always possess advanced and up-to-date navicomputers, civilian and commercial transports with limited astrogation capabilities often rely on information downloaded from these devices to keep charts of their common runs up to date.  This involves a certain amount of risk, as pirates have been known to tamper with buoys in an effort to lure careless merchant vessels into a trap, but in most parts of space, the buoy network is a reliable (and certainly less expensive) alternative to onboard astrogation.  Nav buoys have also been used by governments and independent organizations for the purpose of spying and tracking ship movements, though the low-power nature of these devices prevents them from doing much more than passive data acquisition.", 1001)
  $end_multi_text
  $Collision LOD:				    1
  $Damp: 						        0.2
  $Rotdamp: 					      1.0 ; big ship rot damp
  $Max Velocity: 				    0.0, 0.0, 0.0
  $Rotation time: 			    20.0, 20.0, 20.0
  $Rear Velocity: 			    0.0
  $Forward accel: 			    0.0
  $Forward decel: 			    0.0
  $Ship Death Effect:           PE_Explosion_Ship_Small_Rebel
  $Skip Death Roll Percent Chance:     100
  $Default PBanks: ()
  $Default SBanks: ()
  $SBank Capacity: ()
  $Shields: 					      0
  $Power Output:            0 ;;set this here to avoid debug crashes since this has no systems
  $Shield Regeneration Rate:    0.00
  $Max Oclk Speed: 			    0.0
  $Max Weapon Eng: 			    0.0
  $Hitpoints: 				      100
  $Hull Repair Rate:            0.0
  $Subsystem Repair Rate:       0.0
  $Armor Type:				      Capital_Hull_Armor
  $Shield Armor Type:       Capital_Shield_Armor
  $Flags:                   ( "model point shields" "navbuoy" "disable all generic impact debris" "disable all generic explosion debris" "no ets" "intrinsic no shields" )
  $AI Class: 				   	    AI_07_Captain
  $Afterburner: 				    NO
  $Scan time: 				      2000
  $EngineSnd: 				      -1
  $Closeup_pos:      			  0.0, 0.0, -15
  $Closeup_zoom:     			  0.3
  $Closeup_pos_targetbox:   0.0, 0.0, -15  
  $Closeup_zoom_targetbox:  0.3
  $Shield_icon:             _Shield-Navbuoy
  $Score:             		  0
  $Radar Image 2D:              radar-buoy
  $3D Radar Blip Size Multiplier: 2.5
  ;

